    "content": "<p>Attention, Pilots! Grab a <strong>Zeus Weapon for free </strong>when you <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/subscribe\">subscribe</a> to the official War Robots: Frontiers newsletter, and stay updated on the latest developments on the Wild Ten.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"http://warrobotsfrontiers.com/subscribe\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2024/05/117-Newsletter/Subscribe/en.png\" /></strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>You&rsquo;ll get all the latest updates and missions straight to your inbox so you can gear up with all the intel you need to dominate the battlefield.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need a new wingman? Enlist for War Robots: Frontiers transmissions via <a href=\"https://m.me/wrfrontiers?ref=w24115252\">Messenger</a> and meet your new AI co-Pilot! Add a <strong>free Vortex Weapon </strong>to your Hangar by confirming your subscription, and prepare for briefings on updates, events, and new battle gear.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"http://m.me/wrfrontiers?ref=w24115252\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2024/05/117-Newsletter/Enlist/EN.png\" /></strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>See you on the Wild Ten, Pilots!</p>",
